@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Happy path: Create message with all fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_token": "valid-qr-token-here",
  "message_type": "photo",
  "content": "Scanner feedback message",
  "location_latitude": 37.7749,
  "location_longitude": -122.4194
}

### Happy path: Create message with minimal fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_token": "valid-qr-token-here",
  "message_type": "text"
}

### Happy path: Create message with optional content
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_token": "valid-qr-token-here",
  "message_type": "text",
  "content": "This is a text message from the scanner"
}

### Happy path: Create message with location only
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_token": "valid-qr-token-here",
  "message_type": "photo",
  "location_latitude": 40.7128,
  "location_longitude": -74.0060
}

### Happy path: With session tracking headers
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-Forwarded-For: 203.0.113.5
X-Session-ID: scanner-session-abc123

{
  "qr_token": "valid-qr-token-here",
  "message_type": "text",
  "content": "Message with session tracking"
}

### Error: Missing required qr_token
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message_type": "text"
}

### Error: Missing required message_type
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_token": "some-token"
}

### Error: Invalid/nonexistent qr_token
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_token": "nonexistent-qr-token-xyz",
  "message_type": "text"
}

### Error: Malformed JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_token": "token",
  "message_type": "text",
  invalid json here
}

### Error: Invalid latitude/longitude (out of bounds)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_token": "valid-qr-token-here",
  "message_type": "photo",
  "location_latitude": 91.0,
  "location_longitude": -122.4194
}

### Edge case: Empty string values
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_token": "",
  "message_type": ""
}

### Edge case: Very long content
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qr_token": "valid-qr-token-here",
  "message_type": "text",
  "content": "This is a very long message that contains a lot of text to test how the API handles larger payloads. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat."
}
